# Bloom plan-mode / agent QA

Follow `docs/QA_CHECKLIST.md`.

- Roles: Coordinator → SpecChecker → Implementer → Breaker → Fixer → VisualQA → AgentQA → Verifier → Committer
- After any fix: tests/typecheck → Verifier PASS on workstream rows → **Committer commits** before starting the next workstream
- Zero Cursor branding / Co-authored-by on commits
- Push only when the user asks
- Autonomous on-chain broadcast only when `agent_mode=autonomous` and kill switch is off
